{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassTheory.CentreCocentreDescent","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassTheory.CentreCocentreDescent","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Projection","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Algebra.Subalgebra.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Matrix.Notation","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Matrix.Mul","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Algebra.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.LinearCombination","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FinCases","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Abel","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Algebra.Bilinear"],"declarations":29,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.hecke_g1_not_central","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.hecke_g1_not_central","kind":"theorem","line":296,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/centre-cocentre-descent.lean#L296-L307","doc":"**`g_1` is not central in any algebra mapping onto the explicit\nrepresentation** — in particular in `H_3(q)` over any nontrivial\ncommutative ring (whose presentation makes `g_i ↦ G_i` an algebra map,\nby `G1_quad`, `G2_quad`, `G_braid`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.G_not_comm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.G_not_comm","kind":"theorem","line":287,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/centre-cocentre-descent.lean#L287-L294","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.G_braid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.G_braid","kind":"theorem","line":277,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/centre-cocentre-descent.lean#L277-L285","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.G2_quad","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.G2_quad","kind":"theorem","line":266,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/centre-cocentre-descent.lean#L266-L275","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.G1_quad","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.G1_quad","kind":"theorem","line":255,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/centre-cocentre-descent.lean#L255-L264","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.G2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.G2","kind":"def","line":252,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/centre-cocentre-descent.lean#L252-L253","doc":"`g_2 ↦ G2` ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.G1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.G1","kind":"def","line":250,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/centre-cocentre-descent.lean#L250-L251","doc":"`g_1 ↦ G1` ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.descent_range_not_central","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.descent_range_not_central","kind":"theorem","line":235,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/centre-cocentre-descent.lean#L235-L244","doc":"For any retraction pair `𝔡 ∘ ℓ = id`, the idempotent `τ̂ = ℓ ∘ 𝔡`\nfixes `range ℓ`; so if `range ℓ` contains a non-central element, the\ndescended image `range τ̂` is not contained in the centre. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.refl_involutive","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.refl_involutive","kind":"theorem","line":223,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/centre-cocentre-descent.lean#L223-L226","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.refl","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.refl","kind":"def","line":219,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/centre-cocentre-descent.lean#L219-L221","doc":"The centre reflection `θ_Z = 2·desc − id` is an involution\n(+1-eigenspace `Z(A)`, −1-eigenspace `[A,A]`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.desc_map_anti","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.desc_map_anti","kind":"theorem","line":196,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/centre-cocentre-descent.lean#L196-L217","doc":"`desc` commutes with every `K`-linear anti-automorphism\n(`θ(ab) = θ(b) θ(a)`), e.g. the Hecke anti-involution `T_w ↦ T_{w⁻¹}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.desc_map_auto","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.desc_map_auto","kind":"theorem","line":175,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/centre-cocentre-descent.lean#L175-L194","doc":"`desc` commutes with every `K`-algebra automorphism. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.trace_eq_trace_desc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.trace_eq_trace_desc","kind":"theorem","line":166,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/centre-cocentre-descent.lean#L166-L173","doc":"Every trace factors through the descended part: the transient part is\ntrace-invisible. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:thm:centre-cocentre-descent","label":"thm:centre-cocentre-descent","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/centre-cocentre-descent.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.desc_mul_central","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.desc_mul_central","kind":"theorem","line":140,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/centre-cocentre-descent.lean#L140-L164","doc":"`desc` is `Z(A)`-linear. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.desc_idem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.desc_idem","kind":"theorem","line":137,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/centre-cocentre-descent.lean#L137-L138","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.decomp_unique","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.decomp_unique","kind":"theorem","line":128,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/centre-cocentre-descent.lean#L128-L135","doc":"Uniqueness of the splitting. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.desc_of_comm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.desc_of_comm","kind":"theorem","line":125,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/centre-cocentre-descent.lean#L125-L126","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.desc_of_centre","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.desc_of_centre","kind":"theorem","line":122,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/centre-cocentre-descent.lean#L122-L123","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.trans_mem_commSpan","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.trans_mem_commSpan","kind":"theorem","line":114,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/centre-cocentre-descent.lean#L114-L120","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.desc_mem_center","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.desc_mem_center","kind":"theorem","line":111,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/centre-cocentre-descent.lean#L111-L112","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.desc_mem_centreSub","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.desc_mem_centreSub","kind":"theorem","line":108,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/centre-cocentre-descent.lean#L108-L109","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.decomp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.decomp","kind":"theorem","line":105,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/centre-cocentre-descent.lean#L105-L106","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.trans","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.trans","kind":"def","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/centre-cocentre-descent.lean#L102-L103","doc":"The transient part `x − desc x`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.desc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.desc","kind":"def","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/centre-cocentre-descent.lean#L98-L100","doc":"The descended (central) part: projection onto `Z(A)` along `[A,A]`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.isCompl_of_comm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.isCompl_of_comm","kind":"theorem","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/centre-cocentre-descent.lean#L80-L93","doc":"Non-vacuity of the hypothesis: every commutative algebra satisfies it\n(`Z(A) = A`, `[A,A] = 0`).  The split-semisimple instance\n(`⊕_λ M_{d_λ}(K)`, `d_λ` invertible) is classical and not formalised here. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.trace_vanish_commSpan","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.trace_vanish_commSpan","kind":"theorem","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/centre-cocentre-descent.lean#L69-L78","doc":"Every trace kills `[A,A]`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.mem_centreSub_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.mem_centreSub_iff","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/centre-cocentre-descent.lean#L65-L67","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.centreSub","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.centreSub","kind":"def","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/centre-cocentre-descent.lean#L59-L61","doc":"The centre of `A`, as a `K`-submodule. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.commSpan","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.CentreCocentre.commSpan","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/centre-cocentre-descent.lean#L55-L57","doc":"The `K`-span of all additive commutators `ab − ba`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}